{
  "_meta": {
    "format": 2,
    "source": "library",
    "internalName": "PluginJPHelper",
    "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
    "updatedAt": "2026-11-28"
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "Original": "Plugin JP Helper を開きます。",
      "Context": "Plugin..ctor",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage",
      "Translated": "打开 Plugin JP Helper。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "● 操作待ち",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawBlinkingWorkflowWarning",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "● 等待操作",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "未翻訳・取得",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawMainWindowContents",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BeginTabItem",
      "Translated": "获取未翻译文本",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ヘルプ",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawMainWindowContents",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BeginTabItem",
      "Translated": "帮助",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "クレジット",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawMainWindowContents",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BeginTabItem",
      "Translated": "制作人员",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "コミュニティ",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawDictionarySourcesTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BeginTabItem",
      "Translated": "社区",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "パフォーマンス",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "性能",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "FPS低下や動作の重さを感じる場合だけONにしてください。初期値はOFFです。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "仅在帧率下降或操作卡顿时开启。默认关闭。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ON時は同じ文字列の再判定をキャッシュし、翻訳対象内の処理をさらに軽くします。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "开启后会缓存同一字符串的判定结果，减少处理待翻译文本所需的开销。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "登録外プラグインの早期スキップは、この設定のON/OFFに関係なく常時有効です。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "无论此项是否开启，插件都会提前跳过未登记的插件。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "翻訳漏れなど相性問題が出た場合はOFFにしてください。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "若发生漏译等兼容性问题，请关闭此项。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "文字化け判定設定",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "乱码检测设置",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "翻訳結果だけを判定します。原文側の文字化けはこの設定では停止対象にしません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "只检测译文。原文乱码不会触发此设置的停止条件。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ホワイトリストと判定条件が同時に一致した場合は、ホワイトリストを最優先して警告しません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "原文同时满足白名单和乱码规则时，优先使用白名单，不显示警告。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "登録文字列は実際の文字を表示します。文字列・Unicode欄はドラッグ選択して Ctrl+C でコピーできます。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "下方会显示已登记的实际字符。拖选字符串或 Unicode 一栏的内容，再按 Ctrl+C 即可复制。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "実際に登録されている文字列です。ドラッグ選択してコピーできます。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "此处显示已登记的实际字符串。拖选即可复制。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "左記文字列が ",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "左侧字符串连续出现 ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": " 回繰り返したら検知",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": " 次时报告",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "判定ルールを追加",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "添加检测规则",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "文字列 または U+25A1",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint",
      "Translated": "字符串或 U+25A1",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "入力を認識できません。実文字または U+XXXX 形式で入力してください。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "无法识别输入。请输入实际字符或 U+XXXX 格式的码位。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "制御文字を検知",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "检测控制字符",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "改行・タブ以外の制御文字を検知します。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "检测换行符和制表符以外的控制字符。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ここに一致した翻訳文字列は、他の文字化け判定ルールに一致しても正常扱いにします。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "匹配此处的译文将视为正常，即使它也匹配其他乱码规则。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ホワイトリストは文字化け判定ルールより優先されます。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "白名单优先于乱码检测规则。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ホワイトリストを追加",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "添加白名单规则",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "名前（例：フランス語 Âmes）",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint",
      "Translated": "名称（例：法语 Âmes）",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "文字列 または U+XXXX",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint",
      "Translated": "字符串或 U+XXXX",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "部分一致でホワイトリスト登録",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "按部分匹配加入白名单",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ホワイトリストに追加",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "加入白名单",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "文字化けを検知した項目は、その場では元Manifestの原文へ戻しています。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "检测到乱码的条目会立即恢复为原始清单中的文本。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ここで保存するまでは、再翻訳・翻訳除外の指定は今回のPJH起動中だけの仮処理です。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "在此保存前，重新翻译和排除翻译的设置仅对本次 PJH 会话生效。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "最終的に『現在の翻訳ファイルへ上書き保存』を押すと、現在使用中のPlugin Installer翻訳ファイルへ確定保存します。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "点击“覆盖保存到当前译文文件”，将变更写入 Plugin Installer 当前使用的译文文件。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "修復履歴はありません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "暂无修复记录。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "現在の翻訳",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn",
      "Translated": "当前译文",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "翻訳前の原文",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawSettingsTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TableSetupColumn",
      "Translated": "翻译前的原文",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "残り ",
      "Context": "Plugin.GetGitHubApiRateLimitStatusText",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "剩余 ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "・リセット ",
      "Context": "Plugin.GetGitHubApiRateLimitStatusText",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "· 重置 ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ごろ",
      "Context": "Plugin.GetGitHubApiRateLimitStatusText",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "左右",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "GitHub API（公式・コミュニティ共通）: ",
      "Context": "Plugin.GetGitHubApiRateLimitStatusText",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "GitHub API（官方与社区共用）： ",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "・レート制限中",
      "Context": "Plugin.GetGitHubApiRateLimitStatusText",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "· 已触发速率限制",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ユーザーが作成・共有したコミュニティ辞書を確認し、必要なものだけダウンロード／更新できます。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "浏览用户创建和共享的社区词典，并按需下载或更新。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "自分の投稿名",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "我的投稿名",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Web投稿時に入力した投稿者名と一致する辞書を [自分] として強調表示します。削除権限の判定には使用しません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "与网页投稿时填写的名称一致的词典将标记为“我的”。此名称不用于判定删除权限。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "コミュニティ辞書一覧を取得",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "获取社区词典列表",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "コミュニティ辞書フォルダーを開く",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "打开社区词典文件夹",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "コミュニティ辞書をアップロード",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "上传社区词典",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "「コミュニティ辞書一覧を取得」を押すとGitHub上の一覧を表示します。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "点击“获取社区词典列表”，即可查看 GitHub 上的词典。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "辞書名・プラグイン名・投稿者・備考で検索",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint",
      "Translated": "按词典名、插件名、投稿者或备注搜索",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "検索をクリア",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "清除搜索内容",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "表示できるコミュニティ辞書がありません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "没有可显示的社区词典。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "選択した辞書をダウンロード／更新",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawCommunityDictionaryTab",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "下载或更新所选词典",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "選択してください",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawPluginDropdown",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.BeginCombo",
      "Translated": "请选择",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "日本語化が有効なプラグインは緑色で表示します。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawPluginDropdown",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "已启用日语翻译的插件将显示为绿色。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "別ウィンドウの関連付け",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "关联独立窗口",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "メイン画面とは別の独立ウィンドウを使うプラグイン向けです。関連付けたウィンドウでも、このプラグインの翻訳辞書を使用します。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "适用于使用独立窗口的插件。关联的窗口也将使用该插件的词典。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Popup / Combo / Tooltip は通常、自動で親ウィンドウを引き継ぎます。ここでは完全に別 Begin() されたウィンドウだけを追加してください。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "弹出菜单、下拉框和提示通常会自动继承父窗口。请在此只添加通过 Begin() 单独创建的窗口。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "関連付け済みウィンドウ名：なし",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "已关联的窗口名称：无",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "関連付け済み：",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "已关联：",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "検出テストモード",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "检测测试模式",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "押したあと、翻訳したい別ウィンドウをゲーム内で開いてください。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "点击后，请在游戏内打开需要翻译的独立窗口。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "新しい独立ウィンドウはまだ検出されていません。",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "尚未检测到新的独立窗口。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "新しく検出：",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "新检测到：",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "この新規ウィンドウを関連付け",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "关联此新窗口",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "ウィンドウ名 / 内部ID",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.InputTextWithHint",
      "Translated": "窗口名 / 内部 ID",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "現在表示中のウィンドウ",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawAdditionalWindowControls",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "当前可见的窗口",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "この一覧はリアルタイムです。対象ウィンドウを閉じると自動で消え、再度開くと戻ります。",
